changelog="2.3.0: the Wi-Fi light turns yellow when the network is connected but stuck behind a sign-in page (hotels, cafés) or has no internet; before, it stayed blue. For this the package turns on NetworkManager's connectivity check (Apple's test page, once a minute), unless you have set up your own. 2.2.0: released together with T6 Front Panel 2.2; no changes of its own. 2.1.0: released together with T6 Front Panel 2.1; no changes of its own. 2.0.1: the page works again when fnOS is set to Chinese; since 1.2.0 it stopped with a "Page error" and showed no readings. 2.0.0: released together with T6 Front Panel 2.0; no changes of its own. Earlier versions: github.com/jiaaom/up6-linux-drivers/releases."

